---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy - Kompress.io" description="Our privacy practices and policies regarding your data.">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6 text-gray-900">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-blue bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
      <h3>File Processing</h3>
      <p>All file processing happens locally in your web browser. <strong>We do not upload, store, or transmit your files or images to any server.</strong> Once you close the tab, any processed data in memory is deleted from your device.</p>

      <h3>Data Collection</h3>
      <p>We do not collect any personal identifying information from you while you use our compression tools.</p>

      <h3>Cookies and Advertising</h3>
      <p>To keep this service free, we may display advertisements. These third-party ad vendors, including Google, may use cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this or other websites. You can opt out of personalized advertising by visiting the relevant ad network settings.</p>

      <h3>Changes</h3>
      <p>We may update this policy occasionally. Any changes will be posted on this page.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
